# 🖥️ Example

### Input

```text
Enter Employee Name: Mohamed
Enter Age: 22
Enter Department: Mechatronics
Enter Salary: 12000
```

### Output

```text
========== Employee Information ==========

Employee Name : Mohamed
Age           : 22
Department    : Mechatronics
Salary        : 12000
```

---

# 📜 Source Code

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "========== Employee Registration =========="

read -p "Enter Employee Name: " name
read -p "Enter Age: " age
read -p "Enter Department: " department
read -p "Enter Salary: " salary

echo
echo "========== Employee Information =========="
echo "Employee Name : $name"
echo "Age           : $age"
echo "Department    : $department"
echo "Salary        : $salary"
```

